From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dynamic Devices BSP Team <bsp@dynamicdevices.co.uk>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 03:35:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] nxp-zigbee-rcp: declare Scarthgap compatibility for LmP v96

The NXP lf-6.12.49-2.2.0 connectivity release targets newer Yocto series,
while Foundries LmP v96 is Scarthgap. Carry the declaration in the explicit
compatibility KAS gates; successful builds and hardware tests remain required.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Foundries LmP v96 compatibility]
---
 meta-nxp-zigbee-rcp/conf/layer.conf | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/meta-nxp-zigbee-rcp/conf/layer.conf b/meta-nxp-zigbee-rcp/conf/layer.conf
--- a/meta-nxp-zigbee-rcp/conf/layer.conf
+++ b/meta-nxp-zigbee-rcp/conf/layer.conf
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@ BBFILES += "${LAYERDIR}/*.bb \
             ${LAYERDIR}/recipes-*/*.bb \
             ${LAYERDIR}/recipes-*/*.bbappend"
 
-LAYERSERIES_COMPAT_nxp-zigbee-rcp = "styhead walnascar"
+LAYERSERIES_COMPAT_nxp-zigbee-rcp = "scarthgap styhead walnascar"
 
 BBFILE_COLLECTIONS += "nxp-zigbee-rcp"
 BBFILE_PATTERN_nxp-zigbee-rcp = "^${LAYERDIR}/"
-- 
2.43.0
